'''G1 Climax 2026 Day 3''' was the third show of the [[G1 Climax 2026]] tournament produced by [[New Okaiken Pro-Wrestling|NOPW]], held on September 9, 2026 at the Tokuyama Municipal Gymnasium in [[Tokuyama]] — the tournament's first night outside the capital. The show featured all five [[G1 Climax 2026|Block A]] Round 2 matches.

The night is remembered for the first draw of the tournament: [[Leoni Masua]] and [[Honda Masanori]] went to the 30-minute time limit in their first G1 meeting — the AOPW representative surviving the Spear of Fangatapu and the Namo Strike to take a point from the IGO Heavyweight Champion. It was the first time in Leoni's two G1 campaigns that he had failed to win a block match, and the first points the champion has dropped in the 2026 tournament.

The show also featured [[Marcus Vance]]'s dismantling of [[Big Stan]] — the workhorse chopping the 211 cm giant down with leg work — and [[The Marauder]]'s rebound win over [[Kengo Vaiahi|Kengo]], whose shortcuts failed him for the first time.

